      "title": {
        "en": "Compassionate doctors and friendly team"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Most pet owners in Uptown praise the veterinary team, specifically commending Dr. Nick Yohanna, Dr. Brian Youk, and Dr. Jermolowicz for their warmth and patience. Clients appreciate that practitioners take time to answer questions thoroughly. However, two critical reviews describe dismissive attitudes and frustration during urgent medical consultations."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 20,
      "title": {
        "en": "Patient care for nervous animals"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers frequently observe that clinical assistants and veterinarians handle anxious dogs and nervous cats with gentle patience. Pet parents appreciate that staff take time to help pets relax before administering shots, blood draws, or routine exams. One owner, however, felt staff appeared uncomfortable handling a large dog."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "communication",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 14,
      "title": {
        "en": "Clear explanations and upfront estimates"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet parents consistently highlight the clinic's transparent medical explanations and helpful treatment recommendations. Many clients appreciate receiving clear cost estimates before procedures and prompt email follow-ups after visits. In contrast, one reviewer reported significant delays and difficulty transferring urgent x-ray files."
      }
    }
  ],
